WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.401
-The FDA is looking
at a new proposed rule

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.769
to ban menthol cigarettes.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:05.204
Here to talk about it is
one of our writers,

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:08.408
Amber Ruffin, in a segment
called "Is This Racist?"

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.876 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:12.378
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:16.015
-The FDA is going
to ban menthol cigarettes.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:20.886
And that's ra--
Well...

00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:24.557
I mean, it -- it is...

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.359
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:27.693
Okay.
No, wait.

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:30.263
I mean, it feels ra--

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:31.931
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:35.000
But is it, like,
all the way racist?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.604
I...
Okay, okay, okay.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.071
You've got to look at the --

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:42.975
Uhh...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:46.112
Yeah, 'cause if I say that,
then that means the other thing,

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.914
so, dicey, dicey, dicey.

00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:51.751
Uh, uh, okay.
Wait. I got it.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.754
It is racist, because
the other cigarettes are --

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:55.955
Well, that's different.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.625
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:00.226
Okay. Wait.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.226
Okay.

00:01:01.226 --> 00:01:02.629
Yeah, okay, wait, no.

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:05.031
Not racist.
Final answer.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.099 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.603
-Amber Ruffin, everybody.

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:12.305
-Wait, no!
I mean, maybe it is a little --

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:14.574
-We got a great show
for you tonight!

